# A MEANINGFUL change is a visible retract-and-replace [LFAC.2.5.3]: a fresh
# fact_id, a FACT_RETRACT + FACT_ASSERT pair, exactly one live fact. And the
# replacement is a new fact, so the rule fires again.
assert Sensor entity_id=kitchen state=10.0
pump
assert Sensor entity_id=kitchen state=99.0
pump
